{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.8,"bg":"bg_adv_21442.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800400,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story18","chara":[{"id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Big Bro Haruto, if there's someone you love too,@you can't give up.","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"If you're in love, then you cannot give up!"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(Because I'm not.)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(I can't give up on these feelings of love either...)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(So never, ever give up!)"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":305701,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"That was what I wanted to tell you, big bro..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"...Sure. You're right."},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"It's just as you said,"},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"if I'm really in love, giving up isn't so simple..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"I can't just neglect my own feelings after all, right?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Since it's a crush, and she has her own@circumstances,"},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"I shouldn't lock away my own precious feelings..."},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"...taking a stance like that, now could I..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Yeah... Because that would be so painful."},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Ahaha...I never noticed until you told me."},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"What a bad brother I am..."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...Well, sometimes you are bad, Big Bro Haruto."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(You're so thickheaded that you don't notice@my feelings at all...)"},{"chara":[{"id":800400,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Yeah, there's no arguing there..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800400,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"…………"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Whaaat? You're staring at me."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"You've grown up, Akari."},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Even though you're so little..."},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"You hold onto your own thoughts and teach@your big bro a thing or two."},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"To think you'd come up with something like@\"if you love someone, you can't give up\"..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_013.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...Want to know why I thought that?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Hm? Sure, I'd like to hear."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"It's because there's someone I love too."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":800400,"lipSynch":0}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"…………"},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"[chara:800400:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock]Eh—?! S-someone you love...?!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Ah — no...guess...that's right...@You're also at that age now, huh..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"...Feeling left out?"},{"chara":[{"id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"Ugh..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":800400}],"nameRight":"Haruto Nikaido","textRight":"But, if it's someone Akari likes, they...have to be@a great person...yeah..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305701}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Hehe, he's the most wonderful person,@though a little thickheaded."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(You seriously think I like someone else.)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(I'm a little hurt...)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305701,"lipSynch":0,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(But, someday I know I'll win you over.)"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"(So until then...)"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305701,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"Big Bro Haruto,"},{"chara":[{"id":305701,"motion":400}],"nameLeft":"Akari","textLeft":"for now, I'll still be your little sister."},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"}]},"version":3}
